#: data/co.losno.TabulaSonoraPlayer.metainfo.xml.in:11
msgid ""
"Tabula Sonora plays Standard MIDI Files through a native reimplementation of "
"the Roland Sound Canvas VA synthesizer voice — the SC-55, SC-88, SC-88Pro, "
"SC-8820 and XG tone maps, the GS send effects, and the insertion effects."
msgstr ""

#: data/co.losno.TabulaSonoraPlayer.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"It reads far more than SMF: RIFF-MIDI, DirectMusic MIDS, DOOM MUS, Miles "
"XMI, GMF, both HMI containers, Mobile XMF and LDS tracker files are all "
"converted on the way in, and the file's own loop points are honoured where "
"it declares any."
msgstr ""

#: data/co.losno.TabulaSonoraPlayer.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid ""
"A mixer strip appears for each part the file addresses, showing the sounding "
"instrument, a live voice count, and mute and solo. Songs can be exported to "
"WAV while playback continues, and a MIDI keyboard can be played over a "
"running song."
msgstr ""

#: data/co.losno.TabulaSonoraPlayer.metainfo.xml.in:26
msgid ""
"The synthesizer needs a copy of SCCore.dll from a licensed Roland SOUND "
"Canvas VA installation, which is not included. It is read as data and never "
"loaded as code; the application asks for it on first launch."
msgstr ""

